  "description": "Built with Liv’s 3F Design Philosophy, this 29er has an all new cross-country geometry creating a lightweight frame with a PowerCore bottom bracket for ideal pedaling efficiency to conquer those serious climbs. Pique 29 offers 100 mm of front and rear travel, tuned for women and on the leading Maestro suspension. With remote lockout and a cross country specific dropper post, the Pique 29 is built for XC racers and riders alike. The integrated design accommodates downtube water bottles on all size frames, XS-L. Built with a lightweight ALUXX SL frame, the Pique 29 offers a premium ride at a winning price.",
